{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787774707,"nonce":"JEc28qWp83SyyOb6kbQVqwIU3Dg=","title":"ADR-0037: Environment governance (approval-as-gate, scoped secrets, admission at point-of-use)","message":"\u003e Imported from pull request #1 (MERGED)\n\u003e Branch: `feat/adr-0037-environment-governance` → `main`\n\u003e Created: 2026-07-14T09:11:48Z · Merged: 2026-07-14T09:20:13Z\n\nImplements **ADR-0037** — environments as admin-owned governed bundles (approval + scoped secrets + allowed-refs + OIDC) referenced by name from pipeline YAML.\n\n- **Approval-as-gate on the event log** — `GateApproved { step, by }`; a manual gate accumulates distinct approvers, run stays Suspended until all `approvers` present, then releases exactly-once. No separate approvals table.\n- **Admission moved into the engine** — `allowed_refs` checked at run-creation; approvers gathered from accumulated gate-approval events (never the request body). Standalone `POST …/deploy` admission path retired → read-only history.\n- **Scoped secrets with inheritance** — scope chain `env → repo → org`, most-specific wins; wired into the live run path, log redactor, and fork-PR lockout.\n- **Repo-scoped environments** — re-keyed `(org, repo, name)`; `EnvironmentStore` trait + Postgres/testkit impls; `DeployContext` on the engine `Db` port; env-mgmt CRUD under `/v1/repos/{org}/{repo}/environments`.\n- **Launch-time secret injection** — `SecretInjectingExecutor` decorator resolves a step's declared `secrets:` against the run's env scope (with inheritance), registers with the redactor, honors fork lockout.\n- **Advisory secret parity matrix** — read model (`GET …/secrets/matrix`, Administer cap, names+status never values) + SolidJS Secrets-tab UI.\n\nFull suite green vs local Postgres. Classical style; mock only true externals (ADR-0017). Cluster/registry live paths remain `#[ignore]`.\n\nRefines ADR-0024. See `docs/adr/0037-environment-governance.md`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}